  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a differentiable function in the interval <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;such that <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>for each <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
